-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"consumable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Consumable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10.92<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">April 12, 2016</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20160415181740&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ultimate_Spirit_Potion_0d86f8.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see an ultimate spirit potion.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 3.10 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">This potion can only be consumed by paladins and monks of level 130 or higher.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Aaaah...</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It has a deposit of <b>5 gp</b> and restores between <b>420</b> and <b>580 Hit Points</b>, and between <b>150</b> and <b>250 Mana Points</b>, around <b>500</b> health and <b>200</b> mana on average.<br/>\n<span style=\"line-height: 20px; margin-top: 13px;\"><i> <b>See also:</b> Money Spent per Mana Point and Capacity Taken per Mana Point </i> </span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>The price was further increased from <b>438 gp</b> to <b>488 gp</b> with the Summer 2024 Update on Jul 01, 2024.</li>\n<li>The price was increased from <b>350 gp</b> to <b>438 gp</b>, additionally the Store prices were also raised with the update on October 29, 2018 shown below.\n<ul><li>100x Ultimate Spirit Potions went from <b>26 Tibia Coins</b> to <b>33 Tibia Coins</b>.</li>\n<li>250x Ultimate Spirit Potions went from <b>63 Tibia Coins</b> to <b>79 Tibia Coins</b>.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Alptramun\">Alptramun</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Arbaziloth\">Arbaziloth</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bakragore\">Bakragore</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Black%20Vixen\">Black Vixen</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Brain%20Head\">Brain Head</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Chagorz\">Chagorz</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Count%20Vlarkorth\">Count Vlarkorth</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Court%20Warlock\">Court Warlock</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Drume\">Drume</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Duke%20Krule\"